      "title": "Price target increased by 24% to ₹609",
      "body": "Up from ₹492, the current price target is an average from 3 analysts. New target price is 23% above last closing price of ₹497. Stock is up 28% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹41.10 for next year compared to ₹31.58 last year.",
