      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.90 (down from ₹7.96 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹8.02b (down 4.4% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹444.1m (flat on 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.5% (up from 5.3% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Luxury industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
